/START_PROMPT.md
/PICKUP.md
/devkit/
/.claude/
/1060/
/docs/savedata_route/
/docs/route*.txt
/docs/route_run.log
/docs/ISSUE_ACTION_PLAN_*.md
/bloodborne_upscalers_*.md

# --- Bloodborne-only parts of the ports mbport comes from -----------------------------------------
